WODCAST Studio - project delivery permissions

The recipient may use, copy, modify, host, distribute and further develop the delivered project code and original SVG assets for private and commercial purposes, including engaging another developer. The code imposes no subscription or developer-account requirement.

These permissions do not relicense separately installed Node.js, browser software, system fonts, OBS Studio, Zoom, GitHub tools or optional testing packages. Existing third-party rights remain with their owners.

This notice is not a signed paid-development contract or a certification of legal exclusivity. Any separately agreed exclusive rights transfer applies only to rights that exist and can legally be transferred.
